{1 = 1-39}
After the kingship descended from heaven, 
the kingship was in @wSN{Eridug}. 
In @wSN{Eridug}, 
@wRN{Alulim} became king; 
he ruled for 28800 years. 
@wRN{Alalŋar} ruled for 36000 years. 
2 kings; 
they ruled for 64800 years. 
Then @wSN{Eridug} fell 
and the kingship was taken to @wSN{Bad-tibira}. 
In @wSN{Bad-tibira}, 
@wRN{En-men-lu-ana} ruled for 43200 years. 
@wRN{En-men-gal-ana} ruled for 28800 years. 
@wRN{Dumuzid}, 
the shepherd, 
ruled for 36000 years. 
3 kings; 
they ruled for 108000 years. 
Then @wSN{Bad-tibira} fell (?) 
and the kingship was taken to @wSN{Larag}. 
In @wSN{Larag}, 
@wRN{En-sipad-zid-ana} ruled for 28800 years. 
1 king; 
he ruled for 28800 years. 
Then @wSN{Larag} fell (?) and the kingship was taken to @wSN{Zimbir}. 
In @wSN{Zimbir}, 
@wRN{En-men-dur-ana} became king; 
he ruled for 21000 years. 
1 king; 
he ruled for 21000 years. 
Then @wSN{Zimbir} fell (?) and the kingship was taken to @wSN{Šuruppag}. 
In @wSN{Šuruppag}, 
@wRN{Ubara-@wDN{Tutu}} became king; 
he ruled for 18600 years. 
1 king; 
he ruled for 18600 years. 
In 5 cities 8 kings; 
they ruled for 241200 years. 
Then the flood swept over. 

